# .uhub — haqiqiy eksportlarda mijoz ma'lumoti bo'lishi mumkin; sintetik fixture ham build'ga kerak emas.
*.uhub

# Build'ga kerak emas: mock fixtures, hujjatlar va hisobotlar, viewer relizlari, dizayn hujjatlari.
mock/fixtures/
docs/
releases/
assets/design/
**/*.md

# Kerak (ataylab yuklanadi): assets/brand, assets/icons, assets/illustrations (app.config, ikonkalar, viewer build),
